-- Isolated profiling boundaries for the pure typechecking architecture.
--
-- Fixture construction validates the complete Phase 1-4 chain once. A profile
-- plan then replays exactly one constructor from its immediate accepted input,
-- making setup and measured work explicit and preventing stage/input mismatch.
